    "title": "English Keyboard Online Free — Type English keyboard | WriteWithin",
    "meta_description": "Type English (English keyboard) online free with a virtual keyboard. Use physical keys or on-screen layout, phonetic/IME input when available, emoji, copy, speak, practice phrases, and private local drafts. No install.",
    "h1": "English Keyboard",
    "intro": "Type English instantly in your browser. Switch layouts, use phonetic or IME input when available, insert emoji, copy your text, or practice common phrases. Includes the Apple-style emoji panel shared by every WriteWithin keyboard.",
    "body_html": "<h2>How to type English online</h2>\n<p>Type on the US QWERTY board, or open <strong>😊 Emoji</strong> for Smileys, Flags, and more (same categories as iPhone). Esc on this page simply refreshes English mode; on other language pages Esc switches English ↔ that language.</p>\n<h2>Why use a English virtual keyboard?</h2>\n<p>A clean English board plus emoji is handy on locked-down devices — and it matches the layout language learners see when they toggle Esc on other WriteWithin keyboards.</p>\n<h2>Tips for English writers and learners</h2>\n<p>Use this keyboard to draft in English, then switch languages from the hub. Emoji, copy, speak, and save work the same everywhere.</p>"
  },
  "faqs": [
    {
      "question": "Where is the emoji keyboard?",
      "answer": "Click 😊 Emoji in the toolbar or the emoji key on the bottom row. Browse Apple-style categories, search, and set a skin tone."
    },
    {
      "question": "Do I need to install a English keyboard?",
      "answer": "No. WriteWithin’s English keyboard runs entirely in your browser. Type, copy, and paste into any app — nothing to install."
    },
    {
      "question": "Can I use my physical keyboard for English?",
      "answer": "Yes. The on-screen layout shows which physical key maps to each character. Press Esc to switch between English and English mode."
    },
    {
      "question": "Is my text private?",
      "answer": "Yes. Typing stays on your device. We do not upload what you type to our servers."
    },
    {
      "question": "Does the English keyboard work on mobile?",
      "answer": "Yes. The keyboard adapts for touch screens with large targets, emoji, and a sticky editor on phones and tablets."
    }
